WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Sister Meng, don’t go

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,360
Mr. Shen, he may not know

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,720
Sister Meng, you are well-informed

4
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:07,620
people like me

5
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,860
Can you make five million?

6
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,860
It turns out that Mr. Shen was torturing him

7
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:15,460
But this is too much

8
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:17,730
A wealthy businessman from Hong Kong

9
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,530
The tip alone was 50,000 yuan

10
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,430
Ten fifty thousand is half a million

11
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:24,750
One hundred fifty thousand is five million

12
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:29,380
But that's really not me

13
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,030
Shen Xiujin said

14
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,790
I can sell my hatred, my stupidity, my pity.

15
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,500
But I didn’t even have a chance to express my hatred.

16
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,460
Jian Tong, come with me

17
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,200
Don't you ask me where I want to take you?

18
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,280
If you don’t ask clearly, just come out with me.

19
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,800
Don't be afraid that I will sell you

20
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,720
Sister Meng, stop teasing me

21
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,580
I know I'm not worth the money to replace it.

22
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,620
It was ordered by Mr. Shen

23
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:00,470
This dress was also sent by Mr. Shen.
